# Auth: uses Application Default Credentials (ADC). On Cloud Run, the attached
# service account is used automatically. For local dev, run once:
#   gcloud auth application-default login
#
# Access control is handled by Google IAP (Identity-Aware Proxy) on the
# Cloud Run service — only @harborcap.com users can reach the deployed URL.
# No password is needed for local dev.
